+ *
+ * Jep (co-op): a row is a place on the screen, a select what CCursol holds. Co-op's Multi-player row
+ * (select TITLE_MENU_MULTIPLAYER, title/title_mpmenu.hpp) stands between CONTINUE and OPTION whenever
+ * co-op shows it (TitleMpShown), so the menu is then START, CONTINUE, MULTIPLAYER, OPTION, EXIT: five
+ * rows, set closer and a little higher so they still end above the trademark lines. Without it the
+ * menu is the four rows above, where they always were. Co-op's Multi-player submenus are drawn on the
+ * same rows in the same letters (DrawRow).
